{"id":353,"slug":"form-032","category_slug":"form","name":"可点选单选框","description":"Radio 单选交互","tags":["表单","交互","单选","antd","暗黑模式","iOS","Tailwind","Linear"],"preview_html":"\n<div style=\"padding:20px;display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:14px\" onclick=\"var r=event.target.closest('label');if(!r)return;var g=r.parentNode;g.querySelectorAll('label').forEach(function(x){x.querySelector('input').checked=false});r.querySelector('input').checked=true\">\n  <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" checked><span>男性</span></label>\n  <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\"><span>女性</span></label>\n  <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\"><span>其他</span></label>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可点选单选框：点击标签切换单选选中状态。","prompt_short":"可点选单选框：Radio 单选交互 风格 表单 / 交互 / 单选 / antd","sort":10,"category_name":"表单输入","category_group":"基础控件","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可点选单选框」改成这个观感，只改样式，不重写。\n\n技术栈：按我项目现有的（Vue / Quasar 或 React / Tailwind 均可），不要升级版本，不要引入新依赖。\n\n参照描述：\n设计可点选单选框：点击标签切换单选选中状态。\n\n约束：\n1. props 名称、数据字段、组件层级一律不动，只调整布局 / 间距 / 字号 / 颜色 / 圆角 / 阴影\n2. 需要动效时用项目已有能力降级实现，不新增动画库\n3. 先给 2-3 个方向（每个方向改了什么、风险在哪），我确认后再出代码\n4. 出代码时给完整单文件版本，不要给 diff\n验收：功能不变，构建能过。风格关键词：表单 / 交互 / 单选 / antd / 暗黑模式 / iOS","url":"/v/form-032/","md_url":"/api/v/form-032.md","related":[{"slug":"form-001","name":"shadcn/ui 输入框","tags":["桌面端","极简","shadcn"]},{"slug":"form-002","name":"Linear 命令面板输入（⌘K）","tags":["桌面端","快捷键","Linear"]},{"slug":"form-003","name":"iOS 搜索框","tags":["移动端","iOS","搜索"]},{"slug":"form-004","name":"登录表单","tags":["桌面端","认证","表单"]},{"slug":"form-005","name":"开关 Toggle","tags":["移动端","开关","iOS"]},{"slug":"form-006","name":"复选框","tags":["桌面端","多选","表单"]}]}